      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "The Twins are signing reliever Kevin Ginkel to a two-year contract, a source tells the Star Tribune. He had a 4.12 ERA in 74 games for the Diamondbacks last season with 72 strikeouts in 67.2 innings.",
      "likes": 27,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-26T03:24:31.220Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36pxph6ds22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ツインズがリリーフのケビン・ギンケルと2年契約を結ぶ見通しだと、Star Tribuneに関係者が明かした。昨季はダイヤモンドバックスで74試合に登板し、防御率4.12、67回2/3で72奪三振。"
    },
    {
