      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "The Twins were hunting another reliever with strong swing-and-miss stuff. Kevin Ginkel (26.2% K rate this year) joins Jeff Hoffman, Yoendrys Gómez and Andrew Morris in the back of their bullpen. More on their latest addition: www.startribune.com/kevin-ginkel...",
