      "at": "2026-11-26T03:54:37.287Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36rnjtxnk22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ツインズは空振りを奪える力のあるリリーフをもう1人探していた。ケビン・ギンケル（今季の奪三振率26.2%）が、ジェフ・ホフマン、ヨエンドリス・ゴメス、アンドリュー・モリスとともにブルペン後方を担う。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kevin Gausman has pitched 175+ innings in 8 of last 10 non-pandemic seasons, and fell 1 out shy in another. He has 7 quality starts in 7 career outings in Detroit. He turns 36 in January. Tigers are banking on him providing innings + veteran presence for a young group. www.mlb.com/news/kevin-g...",
      "likes": 15,
      "reposts": 3,
